    title: "Per-function static test selector: seed hypergumbo's reverse slice with only the changed blocks and answer in test functions, falling back to file-level across unresolved/dynamic edges; score it against coverage on the WI-damom test-bed"  # 6745
    status: todo_soft  # 6745
    priority: 3  # 6745
